{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "6e6ac07ee5db4d58ac4a68a08f2c48b94a6b615e1b92e19516b0b53db25caa23", "ja": "もっと強く、もっと激しく", "zh": "更加强烈，更加激烈", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f513b492b6c553e90bff3ea548dd470124bc287d3b7490f60db381ec7db0df0e", "ja": "特別レッスンを経て、少しずつセクシーを\n理解してきた志保。しかし、まだ決め手に\n欠ける……。琴葉は実践しようと言い、\n志保に壁ドンを決める。その日のレッスン\nは、今までで一番の仕上がりになった……。", "zh": "经过特别课程，志保渐渐理解了性感。然而，还是缺少决定性的一招……琴叶说要进行实践，向志保使出了壁咚。那天的课程，达到了迄今为止最好的完成度……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "374464626769894e9ba132a88a51be67c5d1d4ee93da99a5a3eb335ae72d39c8", "ja": "（天体公演のレッスンもいよいよ大詰めだ。みんなの\n表現力が増して、グッと完成度が高まってきたな！）", "zh": "（天体公演的练习终于接近尾声了。大家的表现力都有所提升，完成度也一下子提高了不少！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "ec32985c4f20e65b6ce36ff9e8629b1d7dbc095a35a98cc4e9c69a6d7b079e7e", "ja": "ねえねえ、{$P$}！\nあずささんの公演みせてー！", "zh": "喂喂，{$P$}！\n让我看看阿梓莎小姐的公演嘛——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "996ae7936979adbc8fe2d375f698130582ff12e0501d9520fb6fe6e219ad786d", "ja": "隠してもムダです！　クラブミリオン公演のデータは\n全部持っていると、あずささんから言質をとりました！", "zh": "藏起来也没用！我已经让梓小姐亲口确认了，我手里有百万俱乐部公演的全部数据！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1003_p", "source_sha256": "6388254ce722f058ebfcca78040d2c1d4a40db090a16392e9cc723f74b30868c", "ja": "ああ、リサイタル公演のか。\n探してみるから、ちょっと待っててくれ。", "zh": "啊，是独唱会公演的资料啊。\n我找找看，你稍微等我一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "b31b1dcab256312209f81cebd9c60a25e141487616d3b09381f558a79748bfd7", "ja": "ふう……。やっぱり、私には……。", "zh": "呼……果然，我还是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "78274ccf81bbd5753340d16bb4c9968e33c43b788053c2f1c3b08464fda475c2", "ja": "あれ？　志保ちゃん、もう来てたんだね。", "zh": "咦？志保，你已经到了呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "a98ffc3251f1ee38e8878e644baed1a135f95ec874bece1e884559bcad9d3f8f", "ja": "あっ……お疲れさまです、琴葉さん。\nはい。学校が早く終わったので、先に練習しようかと。", "zh": "啊……辛苦了，琴叶姐姐。\n嗯，因为学校提前放学了，所以想着先来练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "26bb636f429966e3bafb32045d114db2649544f7244bab74f1b2318f88f2aa3e", "ja": "そうだったんだ。……ねえ、志保ちゃん。\nもしかして、まだ悩んでないかな？　歌詞のこと。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。……对了，志保。\n你是不是还在为歌词的事烦恼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "5867b35d0f11ddf5a2a45651e0683b62483039bd1bb37a6ababcbf2121d26ff4", "ja": "それは……。", "zh": "你的意思是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "e27c8f7785df02b42dfc0007cdbff6784be9268ab5b3ee00a483d23ab018c5d0", "ja": "ごめんね。なんだか、難しい顔をしてたから。\n特別レッスンだけじゃ、足りなかったかな。", "zh": "对不起。因为你刚才一副若有所思的表情。\n光靠特别训练，还不够吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1010_033sih", "source_sha256": "cb8b285fe0a8e6ec5b891e96772859a5ec3d5c001000146154f3578788d5ff80", "ja": "……理屈では、わかったような気がしています。\n言葉では伝わらない想いを伝えるための手段ですよね？", "zh": "……道理上，我感觉自己算是明白了。\n就是一种传达无法用语言表达的心意的方式，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "212af14034b40e366ad1956d792f95ccb679c0939fcb51d75f2df818b491f7f7", "ja": "弟が、母や私の頬に、たまにキスをするんです。\nきっと、想いを伝えようとしてくれたんだなって……。", "zh": "弟弟偶尔会亲一下我和妈妈的脸颊。\n我觉得他一定也是想传达自己的心意吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "c44b87a8f451e8af7c94c6a82bb89bd38b90a08ff54e15d34601f3a523031594", "ja": "うん、そうだね。それで十分だと思うけど……\nまだ、何か不安？", "zh": "嗯，是啊。我觉得这样就够了……\n你还有什么不安吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "3c4a2ed96294dcbdcbadacb00b26793e6b5a0a2b30536d3a19294867d558182b", "ja": "頭ではわかりましたけど……。弟は、弟なので。\n恋だとどうなるのかは、あまりよくわからなくて。", "zh": "道理上我是明白了……可是，弟弟就是弟弟。至于谈恋爱会变成什么样，我还不是很明白。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1014_033sih", "source_sha256": "a4829658a34e5acff9b9f5157b30c411986d8b20d3839672eadc87ba3489113a", "ja": "でも、私以外のみなさんは、「好きな気持ち」が\nわかっているみたいなので……。", "zh": "不过，除了我以外的大家，好像都明白“喜欢的心情”是什么……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "388bfb665f6f6e5563ee3d5d9133e1aec496113b7a8ae78b79f2c01af3a499e7", "ja": "話を聞くだけなら、簡単だけど……\n思いは形がないから、実感するのは難しいよね。", "zh": "如果只是听别人讲，确实很简单……\n但心意是无形的，所以要亲身体会还是很难呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "c324ac6eb305c51530e6d23c91cee897beb2bd02cc9cb751ae22eb4ba374b083", "ja": "体験してみるのが一番かもしれないけど、\n急には無理だしね。んー、どうしたらいいのかな……。", "zh": "也许亲身体验一下是最好的办法，\n但也没法一下子做到呢。嗯——该怎么办才好呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1017_033sih", "source_sha256": "993c445cef2b1788b801b13586934bafea46101b7d02d129361a6cc154a8b579", "ja": "すみません。琴葉さんを悩ませるつもりはなくて。\n私の問題ですから、自分でなんとか……。", "zh": "对不起。我没想让琴叶烦恼。\n这是我自己的问题，我会自己想办法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "8eb38465ed1f55ed5a941fef7a17a1a541ad69156a28b3b3f48610dc21ece801", "ja": "やっぱり、実践してみるしかないのかも。", "zh": "看来，或许还是只能亲自实践一下了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "62575bdfccda4535e6222ec7e23fce4d31299bb29d37522a3ef51507bf343c5b", "ja": "実践……？", "zh": "实践……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "eb3b37bbbf28c8c42a285cdbee40163379934986421c4090c7c227a6f7e582ee", "ja": "うん。……志保ちゃん。\nちょっと、目を閉じてみてくれる？", "zh": "嗯。……志保。\n能稍微闭上眼睛试一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1021_033sih", "source_sha256": "caad0eb3efe5595765094e2b9718827fbda4ef2caf0e97c1eb851579ab7f739b", "ja": "えっ？　琴葉さん、あの……？", "zh": "诶？琴叶姐，那个……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1023_033sih", "source_sha256": "4bcaae57c48ca5d5e04b78cd1ff52939ee5c17de011ef34608df436599e177a3", "ja": "こ、琴葉さん！\nあの、距離が！　ち、近いんですけど！？", "zh": "琴、琴叶小姐！\n那个，距离！太、太近了吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1024_se", "source_sha256": "c87d313ee534d741cb20b6a8ebc144b9270c4c5b5eeed687184a6cbde0457de3", "ja": "ドンッ！", "zh": "咚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1025_033sih", "source_sha256": "a0f1adb7995fdaa2e2b88fb721f8431b690661cead8535959e005fcb1e24e264", "ja": "っ！！", "zh": "……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1026_017kth", "source_sha256": "8e27143b0d87f8d31718dac1e6ff693f3ae224177ef648df931ef947c6b44de2", "ja": "……ミュージカルの時は、逆だったよね。\nあの時は私が、志保ちゃんに壁ドンされたんだっけ。", "zh": "……演音乐剧的时候，立场是反过来的吧。\n我记得那时，是我被志保壁咚了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1027_033sih", "source_sha256": "057102b4b552196c44e9c96eade36442256dfbd1c446b3b9e38865965a3010d4", "ja": "あ、あれは、お仕事ですから……。\nそれより冗談、ですよね？", "zh": "啊、那、那是工作需要……。\n比起这个，刚才是在开玩笑吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1028_017kth", "source_sha256": "9fa06faf852114b01dd38b05b95e7ca097158eeccbc3a414b86ca04d3c094fef", "ja": "なにが、冗談？", "zh": "什么是玩笑？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1029_033sih", "source_sha256": "41f74ee592e46256602900fd30055418176527e27991bd3ee442e884b81936a0", "ja": "こ、琴葉さん……っ！！", "zh": "琴、琴叶……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1030_017kth", "source_sha256": "de5117efc7efa27e046b1f83fd9b4da260ca6f158179ce4cf294d49e62192ae0", "ja": "……なんて。\nごめんね、びっくりさせちゃった？", "zh": "……开玩笑的。\n抱歉，吓到你了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1031_033sih", "source_sha256": "748aa23cfdfb08b79383eaa837726ab3e0543db91221ca2463b9d8187eb5c254", "ja": "い、今のは、演技……？\nあ、いえ。当たり前、ですよね。えっと……。", "zh": "刚、刚才那是演戏……？\n啊，没。这也是理所当然的吧。那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1032_017kth", "source_sha256": "df459463b3e5d0a3882b4a2b75246d925aeec026ef110d597d560f8ab73e0520", "ja": "今のはお芝居で、相手が私だったけど。\nもし相手が、志保ちゃんの好きな人だったら……。", "zh": "刚才那是在演戏，对手虽然是我……\n可如果对手是志保喜欢的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1033_017kth", "source_sha256": "fa095f79142a36ffcfccd35827f5e2cedc45ebd699e9b886b25242434e69834f", "ja": "今感じた気持ちより、もっと強くて激しい感情に\n襲われるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "我觉得，你应该会被比刚才感受到的心情更加猛烈、强烈的感情所袭击吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1034_033sih", "source_sha256": "a672f2aa2770ff7ee375e486cb24bb7eba6a2cfc07b386be7a54ae01ca429cad", "ja": "今より、もっと……強くて激しい感情……。", "zh": "比现在更加……强烈而激动的感情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1035_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1036_p", "source_sha256": "90b5511abca2ab2e5f41a9f4fd57249658fa169e472d51e66221fab6f53f7820", "ja": "あれ？　琴葉と志保、もう来てたのか。\nお疲れさま！", "zh": "咦？琴叶和志保，你们已经到了啊。\n辛苦啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1037_033sih", "source_sha256": "d3a1ba6cb6b29a741093a1a9bf7c085681a35a1a818984554bca578309e2fd0e", "ja": "あ……{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "啊……{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1038_029umi", "source_sha256": "f2a6527a6b938277274435faf2b85451c89a6b7ad18006bd89f6e52f4c95ca81", "ja": "お疲れさまー！　って、ふたりとも顔赤くない？\nもしかして、レッスンもう始めちゃってた？", "zh": "辛苦啦——！话说，你们两个的脸是不是有点红？\n难道说，已经开始练习了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1039_028ari", "source_sha256": "fe96c1bf5d03142a9f14d22759cb804d7142b6dff1e7214d8788cf3f52451ad3", "ja": "ふぉぉぉ！　よくわかりませんけど、なんだか\nシャッターチャーンスの予感ですっ！　パシャパシャ！", "zh": "呼呼呼！虽然不太明白，但总觉得\n好像是拍照的好机会！咔嚓咔嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1040_017kth", "source_sha256": "ff74006e5b3c17f299bd56d9ba91019f81f9c42470fed81c3f2102ae34f6c9fc", "ja": "本番も近いし、少しでも長くレッスンしないとって\n志保ちゃんと話してたんです。ね、志保ちゃん。", "zh": "正式演出也快到了，所以我和志保说，得尽量多练习一会儿才行。对吧，志保。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1041_p", "source_sha256": "c0c7c74b0b90d9ef813fd3c55e090cb28593181c667b7b005779929047019bff", "ja": "志保、どうかしたのか？　ぼーっとして。", "zh": "志保，怎么了？怎么在发呆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1042_033sih", "source_sha256": "c431959ef4705a9b2512e4bcb70fe002beb40ff18f5f060b61a3c49634385ef0", "ja": "い、いえ。なんでもありません。\n気にしないでください。", "zh": "没、没事。什么都没有。\n请不用在意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1043_p", "source_sha256": "0af9e9983f06d04a5902191419a7b89e6d4ad15f5b074e6c7a2ab104387c277d", "ja": "そうか。ならいいんだけど……。", "zh": "这样啊。那就好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_05_1044_p", "source_sha256": "6cab5edfc5edc1d55e9a031e3a735948a860d6a0fc4809b7875f60a81a878fe9", "ja": "（その後のレッスンは、今までで一番いい仕上がりに\nなった。本番に向けての準備は、バッチリだな！）", "zh": "（之后的练习成果是有史以来最好的。面向正式演出的准备，已经万无一失了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
